  "user_request_original": "Design a 24-layer periodic dielectric stack on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Stack sequence from air side: HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), then fused silica substrate. Optimize individual layer thicknesses for all 24 layers. Wavelength bands: maximize reflectance in 300-450 nm, maximize transmittance in 1000-1700 nm. Incidence angle: 0 degrees (normal). Polarization: unpolarized (average of TE and TM). Materials: hfo2 and SiO2 (Lemarchand) only. Maximum layer count: 24 (fixed). Use material_catalog dispersion data for hfo2 and SiO2 (Lemarchand).",
